# GitHub API Configuration
# 
# Public GitHub Pages repos are fetched without a token.
# Add a Personal Access Token (PAT) only to raise the GitHub API rate limit:
# 1. Go to https://github.com/settings/tokens
# 2. Click "Generate new token (classic)"
# 3. Select scope: `public_repo`
# 4. Copy the token below
#
# For local development, copy this file to `.env.local` and add your token.
# For CI/CD (GitHub Actions), this value is optional.

GITHUB_TOKEN=your_personal_access_token_here
